# Copy to .env (never commit it). The server reads it at start.
# Key for "ask the workspace" in the Ctrl K box. Use a key from a billing-enabled Google project: on the free tier
# Google may train on prompts and let reviewers read them, and the box sends team issue titles, people and parts.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
# Optional. Any Gemini model id that supports structured output. Defaults to the latest Flash-Lite.
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-flash-lite-latest

# Scouting: FTCScout works without credentials. Additional sources can also be configured
# by an admin under Scouting > Sources. Values saved there override these environment defaults.
# FIRST_API_USERNAME=
# FIRST_API_TOKEN=
# TOA_API_KEY=
# The workspace server must be able to reach the venue's scoring computer. Omit /api.
# FTC_SCOREKEEPER_URL=http://192.168.1.10
# FTC_SCOREKEEPER_KEY=
